WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.178 --> 00:00:01.931
(upbeat music fades)

00:00:01.931 --> 00:00:02.790
- All right, before we go

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.980
I have one more holiday
themed story to share.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.710
This is "What I'm Liking."
(bright upbeat music)

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.900
I love this time of year

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.550
because I love the unique ways

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.170
each of us celebrate Christmas.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.010
No doubt that applies

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.780
to a grandmother from New Jersey.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.540
Crystal and Somerdale has one
of the largest collections

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.820
of black Santa Claus in the country.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.580
She started collecting black
Santas nearly 30 years ago

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.490
and since then it's
built up her entire home.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.450
Let's get her in here.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.610
Everybody say hello to Crystal.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.957
What's up Crystal?
(audience cheering)

00:00:31.957 --> 00:00:32.855
- Hi.

00:00:32.855 --> 00:00:33.688
- Hello.

00:00:33.688 --> 00:00:35.820
So, you have a very good reason

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.800
for loving Christmas so much, right?

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.730
- Yes, I do.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.100
My birthday's on Christmas Eve,

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.196
so how can I not love Christmas?

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:45.090
- Well, I know a lot of people

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.080
that have to share that holiday

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.940
and they don't like it.(laughs)

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:48.773
They get trumped,

00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:50.340
but I love your optimism about it.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.920
So, can you show us a
few of your favorites?

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:53.910
- Sure, I have a couple.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.130
I have the first one I received

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.480
from my late husband.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.883
This was the first one.
- [Kelly] Oh, I love that.

00:00:59.883 --> 00:01:01.800
- It's very special to me.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.000
- I love that though.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.310
So, did your late husband
actually get you into this,

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.870
like starting the collection?

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:07.703
- Yes.

00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:08.536
The first one started,

00:01:08.536 --> 00:01:09.810
we had just moved into our home

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.580
and we said we weren't
buying Christmas gifts

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.413
for each other.

00:01:12.413 --> 00:01:13.590
We got the house.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.970
We were out shopping

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.230
and I saw this

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:18.540
and it was the first time
I ever seen a Santa Claus

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:19.770
of color.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:21.810
So, I was elated in the store.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:22.830
We left the store.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:23.880
I didn't buy it,

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.780
but he surprised me.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.520
He gave it to me for my birthday,

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.780
which was Christmas Eve.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.460
So, it worked out well.
(audience applauding)

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.540
- Oh, I love that.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.100
I love how it started as well.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.050
Well, it's an awesome collection.

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.310
Thank you so much, Crystal,

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.420
for sharing with us.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.935
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:37.935 --> 00:01:39.949
(bell chimes)
(audience cheering)

00:01:39.949 --> 00:01:40.782
- [Crystal] Thank you.

00:01:40.782 --> 00:01:42.330
- All right, well, that's not all.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.030
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen makers of FriXion

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:45.990
that Go-To Erasable Pen

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:47.250
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show" want

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.540
to celebrate people like you

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.800
who share the joy

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.480
and magic of the holiday spirit.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.950
So, they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:53.937
just for being cool.

00:01:53.937 --> 00:01:57.371
(Crystal gasping)
(audience cheering)

00:01:57.371 --> 00:01:58.967
- Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:01:58.967 --> 00:02:00.187
- Yeah!

00:02:00.187 --> 00:02:03.053
Crystal, have such a great holiday.

00:02:03.053 --> 00:02:05.070
Thank you so much, crystal.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.180
Thank you to all our guests.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.240
This our Brendan Fraser,
Sadie Sink, Grinch

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.980
and our very own Grumpy Elf.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.540
If not having a great day
y'all, try and change it.

